invariant: INV-16
file: src/aead_avx512.c
catches: aead_avx512_equiv_test
reason: the last group of the message takes r^16 and r^8 in every lane, as every
  other group does, in place of the powers each lane's blocks are owed, so
  the lanes' total is not the message's polynomial and every tag is
  wrong. bin/aead_avx512_equiv_test runs the text over the lane models on
  every machine and compares each tag with the two-pass AEAD's.

--- old
    absorb_group(h, m, &of_r->last_first, &of_r->last_second);
--- new
    absorb_group(h, m, &of_r->by_16, &of_r->by_8);
